
     
 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.
        
Date: 12/22/88   Time: 22:37EST
        
Items Discussed: Hand-held nuclear detection in Forth, new F-PC manuals, 
                 ROM/ROMmable Forths, Vesta, Inner Access, NMI, SC32 & RTX, 
                 linking to forthers world wide, ACM conference update
