<[Jax] FIGCHAPTERS> a rather IBM-like BIOS underneath, which we also wrote for 
our boards ...
<[Jax] FIGCHAPTERS> our 68008 board will have ...
<[Jax] FIGCHAPTERS> 32-bit standalone indirect-threaded Forth, no BIOS planned 
as yet.
